WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 50 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Why the sudden interest in a creature you once despised?

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:07.100
Without the Astra app, it's just a sick pet.

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.480
We all saw it.

4
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.980
This boy manipulated the creature with his dark magic.

5
00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.720
As honorable dragon knights, it is our sworn duty

6
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.080
to liberate that poor hatchling from his grasp.

7
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:16.760
Exactly.

8
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.600
If he can wreck a holy relic with dark magic,

9
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.840
turning a baby dragon into a monster his child's play handed over.

10
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.720
Now, not a chance.

11
00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.680
I'm not giving up my dragon to anyone, at least of all to you.

12
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.760
Drop the act, Mordak.

13
00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:34.560
You're scared shit-lit, this dragon will grow into a sovereign.

14
00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:38.000
You're just trying to steal a power you'll never earn on your own!

15
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.080
Spare me your fairy tales, Kasperon.

16
00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:54.740
Hand over the dragon, or hand over your lives.

17
00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:56.060
Over my dead body.

18
00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:57.540
Stop! This is on me!

19
00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:58.180
Take me!

20
00:00:58.180 --> 00:00:59.020
Kill me!

21
00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:01.740
Just let my father and my dragon walk away.

22
00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:03.180
Take you?

23
00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:04.780
You aren't worth the dirt on my boots.

24
00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:21.350
How about me then, old man?

25
00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:26.030
Lay one finger on my fiance, and I'll burn this place down with you in it.
